WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.950
To chase, the enemy compares its position with the player's, every frame.

2
00:00:05.827 --> 00:00:10.252
If the enemy is left of the player, a positive speed sends it right.

3
00:00:11.332 --> 00:00:15.832
Otherwise a negative speed sends it left. Then the same for y.

4
00:00:18.724 --> 00:00:23.824
if else always runs exactly one part. The follow block does this for you.
